      "problem": "Find $x$, if $5a-2x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
